/-!
# Characteristic-action witnesses for the small even Ree two candidates

For the 24 indices below, an explicit element outside the representative
normalizes it and acts in the two-core of its full automorphism group.
The finite tables certify an exhaustive word list and all action identities
in the concrete Sylow model by kernel reduction.

The characteristic series used uniformly is the whole subgroup, its first
omega subgroup, the subgroup generated by its squares, and the identity.
Displacements on involutions are products of squares, and every square is
fixed. The intermediate subgroups are characteristic in the whole subgroup;
no characteristicity within one another is assumed.

Source: Shinoda (1975), (2.3), pp. 81–82, for the root convention and concrete
multiplication. The representative words are those fixed in
SmallEvenCandidates. The witness words were found by the exploratory GAP
flag calculation; every required identity is certified here independently.
-/

namespace ReeTwo.SylowModel
open Subgroup

/-- The indices admitting the characteristic-series certificates below. -/
@[expose] public def smallEvenCharacteristicIndices : Finset (Fin 59) :=
  {27, 28, 30, 31, 32, 33, 34, 36, 39, 41, 42, 44, 45, 47, 48, 49, 50, 52, 53, 54, 55, 56, 57, 58}

/-- The characteristic-action subfamily has 24 representatives. -/
public theorem smallEvenCharacteristicIndices_card :
    smallEvenCharacteristicIndices.card = 24 := by decide

/-- Every member of the characteristic-action subfamily has an outside
normalizer witness whose action lies in the automorphism two-core. -/
public theorem smallEvenCharacteristic_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
    (i : Fin 59) (hi : i ∈ smallEvenCharacteristicIndices) :
    (smallEvenCandidate i).HasPCoreNormalizerWitness 2 := by
  simp only [smallEvenCharacteristicIndices, Finset.mem_insert, Finset.mem_singleton] at hi
  rcases hi with rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl
  · exact smallEvenCandidate27_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate28_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate30_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate31_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate32_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate33_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate34_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate36_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate39_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate41_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate42_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate44_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate45_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate47_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate48_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate49_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate50_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate52_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate53_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate54_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
  · exact smallEvenCandidate55_hasPCoreNormalizerWitness
